# TOY example only; FE ARRAY indices 1,2 are NOT Rhine source locations.
# Activated only by source policy 1 in hydroflow.conf. Never infer Q from residuals.
# Number of independently specified source groups.
1
# Number of receiving active FE triangles; number of time records.
2 3
# One FE ARRAY element index per record. Total Q is divided by total group area.
1
2
# time since simulation start [s], TOTAL incoming Q [m3/s], concentration
# C=0 means clean water. Q and Q*C are interpolated linearly separately.
# Series must begin at zero and cover the entire simulation; no extrapolation.
0      10.0 0.0
86400  15.0 0.0
172800 10.0 0.0
